ole  country is deeply concerned by the news  she says my thoughts and the thoughts of  people across our United Kingdom are  with her majesty the queen and her  family at this time now in case you're  just joining us just to clarify the news  coming in to us is that the queen is  currently under medical supervision at  Balmoral her residence in Scotland this  happened after doctors became concerned  for her health that is according to a  statement that has been officially  released by Buckingham Palace now the  queen uh  uh 96 years old  now we know that uh  she pulled she pulled out a virtual  privy Council on Wednesday with doctors  advising her to rest we are now hearing  that Prince Charles and Camilla are  traveling they're all currently  traveling to Balmoral to be with the  queen we don't know at what point they  were informed they were staying nearby  apparently at Burke Hall on the estate  so perhaps they are already with the  queen so just to repeat that Prince  Charles and Camilla traveling to  Balmoral we're also getting news that  Prince William is also on his way to  Balmoral this is the Queen's residence  in Scotland and this is  he's decided to travel there after this  news this announcement on the Queen's  Health that is what we are hearing uh we  can go to our correspondent worry  challenge who is in London  Rory uh what what else are you hearing  about this this is uh coming to us all  by surprise  yeah this is breaking news I mean I  think the things that you have just been  outlining there we've got messages from  the Prime Minister we have uh messages  of concern for the Queen's Health coming  from her doctors we know that the  immediate family have been informed and  are now coming to be with her these are  all the kinds of things that you would  expect to happen if the queen did not  have uh very long to live all these  things being put in place to make sure  that if she does die in the coming days  that her family are there and that the  co